    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Today's forecast, a slight chance of flurries",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Slightly slim chance that they might dance to worries",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And won't know what to say, break to a cutaway",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "DOOM like the rain, known to come back another day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Like this day, like now-a-day, be right there",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Like, \"I'll wait, gimme half a light year\"",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Same time it take y'all to drink a light beer",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Feel the wrath of his truth just like the cast from Nightmare",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Whoever got the cash, the mic, they both right here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "What more can I say? Keep your sights clear",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Bare facts, strip naked to bare backs",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "He only came to jack rare tracks for your earwax",
          "rhyme": "aks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Oh, snap! You hear that? (Naw...)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "DOOM stay way up in the cut like Ma and Pa",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "When he come out, he dumb out, there he go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The villain with the illest flow in all of Mexico",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "All foes on some, \"When he leave out, let me know",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Just so's I can breath out, before I let go\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Rappers is like Satchmo – that, you best know",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Invest in free dough like Matthew Lesko",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Followed by hailstorms, snow, and earthquakes",
          "rhyme": "Eks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Give out more toothaches than first birthday cakes",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "The more we reverse scripts, the worse they fate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "To beat y'all with dimes and dummy Anbesol shake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Now you got a rhyme tummy-ache by mistake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Can't call it, can't call Jake, call cannonball face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Dig tapes and stay in great shape",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Today's rap game is like one big date rape",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "The name ring bell, like \"ring-ding-dong\"",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "He can never be wrong, like \"Ling Ting Tong\"",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Once heard a hit song, sounded like an annoying gong",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "It's so wack, I ain't wanna hit the bong",
          "rhyme": "$N",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Now who get iller with the pen than I do?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "And in it just to get the Benjamin like Netanyahu?",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Let the God bless you, like – \"Achoo!\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Get you, like, \"What's that on your chest?\" (\"Hmm...\") \"Got you\"",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "PNS beat good for you as shredded wheat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "As well as getting shredded by the metal-headed lead feet",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Son 'em and dead 'em, like a dad that's deadbeat",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Beat 'em like a dead horse, nasty as red meat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "DOOM memorize rhymes and still forgot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Call it how he see it and kill a shot, like Willard Scott",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "In the place to be, like no iller spot",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "To spill a knot, it's like a chilling thriller plot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Starring the Villain as the Black Jésus",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "If it ain't the 'gnac or the Jack, it's Grey Goose",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Still could stay loose off grape juice, regardless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Nevertheless, did his best on the retarded test",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "It's trick questions, always kept a cheat sheet",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "On the microphone, a rep up before Beat Street",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "And beat meat, that MF DOOM, he stay true",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "If you online, check the site and F.A.Q. ",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
